  "releaseNotes": "New native HUD packages declare their embedded SDK and required/optional host capabilities. Packaging stamps the actual SDK version; connections stop clearly on an incompatible host. Existing installed HUDs remain supported. Includes recording push with reconnect, round replacement and delayed events; stage 2 economy evidence; stage 3 combat analysis; and nested v3 killfeed trades. No recording HTTP reads or HUD polling; source coverage stays explicit.",
